      "description": "<p>Emergency teams discovered victims after two-storey building in historic Plaka district collapsed ‘in seconds’</p><p>Greek authorities say they are trying to discover what caused a two-storey apartment block in the heart of ancient Athens to collapse “in a matter of seconds”, killing six people.</p><p>Emergency teams found the victims, including four American tourists, on Saturday, more than 24 hours after the early morning explosion in the historic Plaka district.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/sep/26/greek-authorities-seek-answers-after-six-killed-in-athens-apartment-block-explosion\">Continue reading...</a>",
